# Sensitive automation and release controls. Do not cover iocs/**: the
# scheduled refresh workflow is deliberately allowed to auto-merge bounded,
# IOC-only changes after CI succeeds.
#
# ADVISORY ONLY. The Protect main ruleset sets require_code_owner_review to
# false and requires zero approving reviews, so nothing below is enforced —
# these paths are a review checklist, not a gate. Enforcement needs a second
# trusted account, because a sole maintainer cannot approve their own pull
# request and would be locked out of their own repository. If one is ever
# added, set require_code_owner_review and required_approving_review_count on
# the ruleset and delete this paragraph.
/.github/CODEOWNERS @noeljackson
/.github/workflows/** @noeljackson
/.github/actions/** @noeljackson
/.supplychain/** @noeljackson
/.gitleaks.toml @noeljackson
/.goreleaser.y*ml @noeljackson
/action.yml @noeljackson
/scripts/install-ci-tools @noeljackson
/scripts/setup-go @noeljackson
